{"id": "85981", "name": "CR-Diff-09-misc-1.g", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Find the following derivative:\n\\[ \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}({{CT:1}}). \\]\n[[input:ans1]]\n[[validation:ans1]]\n", "generalfeedback": "The simplest way to solve this problem is using the product rule.\n<hint>calc_product_rule</hint>\nDefine \\(f={{CT:2}}\\) and \\(g={{CT:3}}\\) so that \\(f'=\\log({{CT:4}}){{CT:2}}\\) and \\(g'={{CT:4}}{{CT:0}}^{{CT:5}}\\).\n<br/>\nSo,<br/>\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{rcl}\n\\displaystyle\n \\frac{d}{d{{CT:0}}}({{CT:1}}) &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  f\\cdot g' + f'\\cdot g \\\\\n  &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:2}} \\cdot {{CT:4}}{{CT:0}}^{{CT:5}} + {{CT:6}} \\\\\n & =&\\displaystyle  {{CT:7}}.\n \\end{array}\n\\]\n\n\n", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "p1", "p2", "rdm1", "v"], "nvariants": 3}